            <ArticleTitle>Occupational asthma caused by white mushroom.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>219-21</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The commercial growing of white mushroom (Agaricus bisporus) is a frequent activity in certain Spain regions as La Rioja. We report two cases of white mushroom workers suffering from asthma caused by hypersensitivity to basidiocarp and spores of white mushroom.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
